## 5️⃣ Verify the archive before you go live (optional but recommended)

```bash
# Install the official CLI (download the binary from GitHub releases)
pmtiles show world.pmtiles   # prints header, bounds, zoom range, layer names
pmtiles verify world.pmtiles # checks integrity
```

If you see the expected `minzoom`, `maxzoom`, and a list of `source-layer` names, you can safely reference those names in your style.

